Package: jungey
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Jungey OS <jungey@localhost>
Depends: openjdk-21-jre, libgtk-3-0t64, xdg-utils, wmctrl, libnotify-bin, pulseaudio-utils
Recommends: espeak-ng, ffmpeg, tesseract-ocr, brightnessctl, network-manager, xfce4-screenshooter
Homepage: https://github.com/9bista-suven7/jungey-AI
Description: local-first desktop assistant
 Jungey (Just a Unified Neural Gateway Engineered for You) answers everyday
 questions and drives the desktop: time, maths, weather, notes and timers,
 volume, windows, screenshots, camera and screen reading. Simple commands are
 answered on the machine; it reaches the network only when a question needs
 live data.
